26-07-27T18:47:14Z","version":"6.0.260720","wrapperType":"software","currency":"NOK","description":"The official Gmail app brings the best of Gmail to your iPhone and iPad with helpful AI features, robust security, real-time notifications, multiple account support and intelligent search that works across all your emails.\n\nWith the Gmail app, you can:\n• Make Gmail your default email app on iOS\n• Stay up to date on your latest packages, upcoming events, bills and travel details with helpful summary cards\n• Declutter your inbox with built-in email subscription management\n• Use Gemini* in Gmail to summarise lengthy emails, craft or refine responses or search your inbox to find what you're looking for\n• Connect and switch between multiple email accounts from different providers\n• Automatically block more than 99.9% of spam, phishing and malware from ever reaching your inbox\n• Quickly add events to Google Calendar based on your emails with Gemini in Gmail\n• Find top deals faster with a personalised Promotions tab\n• Respond to emails faster with AI-powered Suggested Replies that understand the context of your emails and match your unique tone and style\n• Undo send for up to 30 seconds to prevent embarrassing mistakes\n• Access Google Meet and Google Chat without leaving Gmail\n• Organise your emails by labelling, starring, deleting and reporting spam\n• Swipe to archive/delete to quickly clear out your inbox\n\nGmail is part of Google Workspace, allowing you and your team to easily connect, create and collaborate. You can:\n• Connect with colleagues via Google Meet or Google Chat, send an invite in Google Calendar, add an action to your task list and more, without leaving Gmail\n• Use Gemini in Gmail features like Help me write, Suggested Replies, AI Overviews and Proofread to help you stay on top of work and take care of simple tasks, so you can be more efficient with your time\n• Stay safe. Our machine learning models block more than 99.9% of spam, phishing and malware from reaching our users\n\n*Some Gemini features may require a Google One AI subscription. Internet connection required. Language and country availability may vary. Check responses for accuracy.","minimumOsVersion":"18.0","price":0.0,"userRatingCount":16213}